WEBVTT

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:04.730
So then, you're...

00:00:04.730 --> 00:00:06.770
That's right, Onii-chan.

00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:10.150
You can come to the café any time you want to see a little sister.

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:11.180
Huh?

00:00:11.180 --> 00:00:11.990
Café?

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:14.280
You didn't know?

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:15.490
Look.

00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:20.020
Imouto Café Lyrical Sisters?

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:20.750
What is this?

00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:26.040
A dreamlike café where anybody can
become an older brother or older sister.

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:28.020
I'm the owner, Sagara Mei.

00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:29.170
I'm a third year.

00:00:29.170 --> 00:00:30.420
Third year?

00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:31.640
So, you're my senior?

00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:35.140
I left the café to get to know the area.

00:00:35.140 --> 00:00:39.200
When I said "Onii-chan" before, it was a freebie greeting.

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:44.020
Then, why were you sneaking around and spying on me earlier?

00:00:44.380 --> 00:00:46.890
That had to do with my business.

00:00:46.890 --> 00:00:49.590
I want to know everything about the daily life,

00:00:49.590 --> 00:00:53.530
behaviour and thoughts of the one
and only son of the great president.

00:00:53.910 --> 00:00:55.640
Ah, I see!

00:00:55.640 --> 00:00:56.440
Is that what it is?

00:00:56.440 --> 00:00:58.030
That's what it was about?

00:02:31.240 --> 00:02:34.580
I came to get the official copy of the family register while school was on break,

00:02:34.580 --> 00:02:36.010
but it seems like it was a wasted trip.

00:02:36.880 --> 00:02:40.110
Well, if there were a little sister on the family register,

00:02:40.110 --> 00:02:41.760
I would have known earlier.

00:02:45.180 --> 00:02:46.560
Don't make any noise!

00:02:46.560 --> 00:02:49.850
Walk quietly like this and go into that alley.

00:02:53.360 --> 00:02:55.270
I'm sorry for surprising you.

00:02:55.270 --> 00:02:58.490
I wanted to talk to you somewhere without any people.

00:02:59.900 --> 00:03:02.220
My name is Mister X!

00:03:02.220 --> 00:03:05.960
I deal with the Mikadono Group's problems behind closed doors.

00:03:05.960 --> 00:03:07.580
I'm associated with the Clear Stream Organisation.

00:03:07.580 --> 00:03:10.290
What business do they have with me?

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:12.250
I'll get straight to the point.

00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:15.250
Why are you investigating your father?

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:16.210
That's...

00:03:16.710 --> 00:03:19.470
Are you worried about a hidden child?

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:21.550
Looks like I hit the bull's-eye.

00:03:21.550 --> 00:03:23.680
My father's illegitimate child...

00:03:23.680 --> 00:03:26.760
Is it true that I have a little sister?

00:03:26.760 --> 00:03:28.140
It seems to be true.

00:03:28.140 --> 00:03:28.970
Seems to be?

00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:33.300
Kanoko once said he had a close associate.

00:03:33.300 --> 00:03:38.230
Mr. Kumagorou had one child with another woman.

00:03:38.820 --> 00:03:41.280
Then, that phone call was...

00:03:44.790 --> 00:03:49.500
I wonder if what that "Mister X" guy said yesterday was true...

00:03:51.610 --> 00:03:54.750
A phone call from a little sister whose identity you don't know, huh?

00:03:54.750 --> 00:03:58.630
Yet she seems to want to marry me.

00:03:58.630 --> 00:04:00.310
Marry you?

00:04:00.310 --> 00:04:01.880
Your little sister said that on the phone?

00:04:02.210 --> 00:04:04.760
No, that's not it, but...

00:04:05.970 --> 00:04:09.470
I-I've come to marry Onii-sama!

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:12.980
Hmm... This is worrying.

00:04:12.980 --> 00:04:15.980
If you married your little sister, and she's your blood relative...

00:04:15.980 --> 00:04:18.650
If this comes to light later,

00:04:18.650 --> 00:04:21.660
it would be a huge scandal that would shake the Mikadono Group.

00:04:21.660 --> 00:04:25.240
A scandal or not, I can't approve of something like that.

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:31.450
Besides, if that happened, I'm sure my little sister would become unhappy.

00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:34.360
If I really do have a little sister,

00:04:34.360 --> 00:04:38.000
I would definitely not want that for her.

00:04:38.920 --> 00:04:40.220
That's right!

00:04:40.220 --> 00:04:43.420
If my mother knows about the illegitimate child, then...

00:04:43.420 --> 00:04:46.640
Unfortunately, when the subject of the illegitimate child came up,

00:04:46.640 --> 00:04:48.820
it seems she did not know about it,

00:04:48.820 --> 00:04:51.860
nor did she want to see her or know her name.

00:04:51.860 --> 00:04:55.940
The only people who would know about the illegitimate child are the deceased Kumagorou,

00:04:56.300 --> 00:04:59.690
the child's mother, and the child itself.

00:04:59.690 --> 00:05:01.170
I see!

00:05:01.170 --> 00:05:02.280
Shougo-kun.

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:06.820
Are there any girls with whom you've
suddenly became friends with recently?

00:05:08.120 --> 00:05:11.170
If your little sister came to marry you,

00:05:11.170 --> 00:05:14.210
then I fear she would do something like that to get closer to you.

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:20.290
Girls with whom I've recently suddenly became friends with, huh?

00:05:20.290 --> 00:05:22.340
Shougo-san!

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:26.590
Dance party?

00:05:26.590 --> 00:05:27.810
Yes.

00:05:27.810 --> 00:05:29.170
Every year at this time,

00:05:29.170 --> 00:05:33.020
the student council organises a social dance party.

00:05:33.020 --> 00:05:36.190
By "social dance", you mean boys and girls dancing together?

00:05:36.190 --> 00:05:36.950
Yes.

00:05:36.950 --> 00:05:38.350
So, um...

00:05:38.770 --> 00:05:41.230
If you like, would you come with me?

00:05:41.230 --> 00:05:43.110
Sure. I will!

00:05:43.570 --> 00:05:44.360
All right then!

00:05:48.910 --> 00:05:51.240
If you don't hurry up, you'll be late.

00:06:00.170 --> 00:06:02.780
From today on, I'll be studying in this class.

00:06:02.780 --> 00:06:03.840
My name is Mizutani Ikusu.

00:06:04.340 --> 00:06:05.670
Pleased to meet you.

00:06:06.220 --> 00:06:08.090
What a pretty face.

00:06:08.090 --> 00:06:11.140
Mikadono-kun is pretty attractive, but so is Mizutani-kun.

00:06:11.140 --> 00:06:13.390
I'm so glad I'm in this class.

00:06:13.390 --> 00:06:14.520
Sensei?

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:15.850
What is it, Tanaka?

00:06:15.850 --> 00:06:19.140
Just the other day Mikadono-kun transferred,

00:06:19.140 --> 00:06:22.730
so why do we have another new transfer student in this class?

00:06:22.730 --> 00:06:23.360
Dunno.

00:06:23.710 --> 00:06:27.860
But I hate people who worry about trivial things like that.

00:06:28.610 --> 00:06:29.110
Hey.

00:06:32.580 --> 00:06:34.340
Cute little kitten.

00:06:34.340 --> 00:06:37.830
Sorry, but could you let me have this seat?

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:38.900
Y-Yes.

00:06:38.900 --> 00:06:40.120
Gladly.

00:06:47.420 --> 00:06:49.010
What on earth is happening?

00:06:49.590 --> 00:06:53.800
Ah, since it's "Mister X", I chose Mizutani Ikusu!

00:06:53.800 --> 00:06:55.970
That's not what I'm talking about.

00:06:55.970 --> 00:06:58.430
I'm asking why you've come to the school.

00:06:58.430 --> 00:07:00.540
Isn't that obvious?

00:07:00.540 --> 00:07:03.110
To protect you from the malicious influence of your little sister.

00:07:03.110 --> 00:07:07.230
It's easier to investigate if I stay close to you like this.

00:07:07.230 --> 00:07:09.320
Well, that's true, but...

00:07:09.320 --> 00:07:12.040
The little sister is hiding her identity.

00:07:12.040 --> 00:07:14.290
She's close by, and she's targeting you.

00:07:14.290 --> 00:07:19.580
If there's anyone suspicious, I can tell who they are by doing a DNA test.

00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:20.480
If I do that,

00:07:20.480 --> 00:07:22.790
we can find out who your blood-related sister is right away.

00:07:22.790 --> 00:07:25.840
Is that something that can be done so easily?

00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:29.090
Taking cells and testing blood sounds difficult.

00:07:29.090 --> 00:07:30.720
No need to worry.

00:07:30.720 --> 00:07:33.120
I can discreetly collect a saliva sample,

00:07:33.120 --> 00:07:36.060
and then send it to a contractor.

00:07:36.060 --> 00:07:40.230
But the girl is hiding the fact that she is my little sister.

00:07:40.230 --> 00:07:42.600
You can't make a judgement like that.

00:07:42.600 --> 00:07:44.020
I see.

00:07:44.020 --> 00:07:48.980
Then, it may be best to simply ask for a sample of saliva.

00:07:48.980 --> 00:07:51.820
If I don't give a reason for asking for their spit,

00:07:51.820 --> 00:07:53.610
they might think I'm a pervert.

00:07:53.610 --> 00:07:55.240
Well then, should we use this?

00:07:56.530 --> 00:08:01.290
If we inject them with this chemical, they'll be slobbering like a dog.

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:02.160
Hey!

00:08:02.160 --> 00:08:03.500
It's okay.

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:06.040
The effects will wear off in a week.

00:08:06.040 --> 00:08:10.170
The only after-effect will be slurred speech.

00:08:10.170 --> 00:08:12.050
That's not okay at all!

00:08:13.430 --> 00:08:14.590
Ah, he's here, he's here!

00:08:15.140 --> 00:08:17.260
So you were with Mikadono-kun, after all.

00:08:17.260 --> 00:08:18.890
What were you doing here alone?

00:08:18.890 --> 00:08:22.100
Hey, let me see too!

00:08:23.140 --> 00:08:26.230
Ikusu, let's talk in my room after school.

00:08:26.580 --> 00:08:27.700
Roger.

00:08:27.700 --> 00:08:29.480
I'm looking forward to it.

00:08:32.860 --> 00:08:36.740
Hey, we're guys, so do we really need to go home arm-in-arm?

00:08:37.450 --> 00:08:40.740
Thanks to this, we got here without anyone bothering us, right?

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:44.830
But I have a feeling it created a huge misunderstanding.

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:51.130
Make yourself at home. You can sit anywhere you like!

00:08:51.130 --> 00:08:52.050
Shougo-kun.

00:08:52.050 --> 00:08:54.430
Before that, is it okay if I take a shower?

00:08:54.430 --> 00:08:56.270
As a general rule for covert actions,

00:08:56.270 --> 00:08:57.300
I get rid of my body odour if possible.

00:08:57.300 --> 00:09:00.010
I need to do it so my presence here cannot be detected.

00:09:00.290 --> 00:09:02.140
Do what you want.

00:09:02.140 --> 00:09:03.180
I'm indebted to you.

00:09:03.180 --> 00:09:03.770
Well, then.

00:09:07.190 --> 00:09:10.610
I'm saying this just to make myself clear,

00:09:10.610 --> 00:09:13.150
but no peeking while I'm in the shower, okay?

00:09:13.150 --> 00:09:14.530
I won't peek!

00:09:15.530 --> 00:09:17.440
Oh, that's right.

00:09:17.440 --> 00:09:19.030
I left a bath towel on the veranda to air dry.

00:09:22.330 --> 00:09:23.290
Here's a bath towel.

00:09:31.050 --> 00:09:33.050
A girl...?

00:09:43.770 --> 00:09:48.440
It's pleasing to see that the Mikadono Group's stock prices are doing favourably today.

00:09:48.830 --> 00:09:54.320
So, the Mikadono clear stream organisation is a traditional one that only allows men to enter?

00:09:54.320 --> 00:09:55.570
Oh?

00:09:55.570 --> 00:09:59.570
The Kyoasu company announced a mobile telephone with a new feature built in.

00:09:59.570 --> 00:10:02.630
But, aiming to become a ninja,

00:10:02.630 --> 00:10:04.830
Ikusu hid her gender and entered the organisation.

00:10:05.160 --> 00:10:07.080
Speaking of which,

00:10:07.080 --> 00:10:10.290
I heard Kyoasu was going to release a
ground breaking new feature this year.

00:10:10.290 --> 00:10:14.340
I wonder if this timing will result in good fortune, or rather misfortune...

00:10:14.840 --> 00:10:20.300
Every day she must expose all of her naked body to the open air...

00:10:20.300 --> 00:10:24.850
...for a set amount of time to hide her presence from the surroundings.

00:10:25.390 --> 00:10:27.180
What do you think, Shougo-kun?

00:10:27.180 --> 00:10:30.440
I want to hear the opinion of the next president of the Mikadono Group.

00:10:30.440 --> 00:10:31.520
My opinion?

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:32.940
My opinion is...

00:10:32.940 --> 00:10:33.480
Yeah?

00:10:33.480 --> 00:10:37.490
I'm begging you, please wear some clothes already!

00:10:41.490 --> 00:10:42.620
Today is lovely as well!

00:10:54.630 --> 00:10:57.090
Thanks for waiting, Shougo-san.

00:10:58.300 --> 00:11:00.390
It's the first time I've worn this dress.

00:11:00.390 --> 00:11:01.840
Does it not suit me?

00:11:02.550 --> 00:11:03.930
No, it does.

00:11:03.930 --> 00:11:05.850
You look more mature in it.

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:20.610
This really is a full-fledged party.

00:11:22.450 --> 00:11:25.200
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:11:25.200 --> 00:11:29.370
Welcome to the student council hosted dance party!

00:11:30.750 --> 00:11:32.460
W-What's that?

00:11:38.300 --> 00:11:39.920
Yay!

00:11:39.920 --> 00:11:42.260
Everybody, join in!

00:11:43.260 --> 00:11:45.180
She's pretty high-spirited, huh?

00:11:45.180 --> 00:11:48.100
That's Tendou Mana-san, the president of the student council.

00:11:48.100 --> 00:11:51.380
Although she's usually a bit quieter.

00:11:51.380 --> 00:11:54.900
Events like this tend to get people to be more lively, almost like another person.

00:11:54.900 --> 00:11:58.900
There! There! There!

00:11:59.270 --> 00:12:00.220
Eh?

00:12:00.220 --> 00:12:01.150
Why?

00:12:01.150 --> 00:12:03.030
It was going to get even more high-spirited from here...

00:12:03.030 --> 00:12:05.030
It's not meant to be high-spirited!

00:12:06.160 --> 00:12:08.660
Today's party isn't like that.

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:11.580
Rinka-chan is so mean.

00:12:11.580 --> 00:12:13.580
Please do it properly.

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:15.790
The student council's reputation will be ruined.

00:12:16.130 --> 00:12:17.090
Who's that girl?

00:12:17.090 --> 00:12:18.670
Kunitachi Rinka-san.

00:12:19.300 --> 00:12:21.090
She's still a first year,

00:12:21.090 --> 00:12:23.800
but she's the vice president of the student council.

00:12:23.800 --> 00:12:25.200
First year?

00:12:25.200 --> 00:12:26.850
Didn't she just get accepted?

00:12:26.850 --> 00:12:30.220
The previous vice president had to
transfer out and they had a problem,

00:12:30.220 --> 00:12:36.400
and then she took the position, announcing she was
the descendant of a former noble family.

00:12:38.610 --> 00:12:41.740
Everyone, I am so sorry for troubling you all.

00:12:41.740 --> 00:12:47.660
Thank you for participating in the dance party hosted by our student council.

00:12:51.830 --> 00:12:53.210
Shall we dance as well?

00:12:53.210 --> 00:12:57.630
Sure, but I'm not all that used to dancing.

00:12:57.630 --> 00:13:00.090
If I can't dance well, I'm sorry.

00:13:00.460 --> 00:13:01.480
It'll be fine.

00:13:01.480 --> 00:13:02.710
I'll lead you.

00:13:03.420 --> 00:13:04.470
All right!

00:13:12.850 --> 00:13:16.190
You said you weren't used to it, but you dance pretty well.

00:13:16.190 --> 00:13:19.230
Oh no... It's only because you are so good at it, Shougo-san.

00:13:30.030 --> 00:13:31.860
Well done, Tsuruma!

00:13:31.860 --> 00:13:33.410
I'm impressed.

00:13:35.710 --> 00:13:38.210
Hey, hey, Konoe-chan, can I be next?

00:13:38.210 --> 00:13:39.380
Will you dance with me?

00:13:39.380 --> 00:13:41.130
Eh? Um...

00:13:41.130 --> 00:13:44.130
As expected of Mikadono-senpai.

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:47.380
Will you be my partner next?

00:13:47.720 --> 00:13:50.180
Eh... But...

00:13:50.600 --> 00:13:53.280
If you aren't confident in your dancing,

00:13:53.280 --> 00:13:55.930
then shall I offer to be the lead?

00:14:14.580 --> 00:14:17.870
Your skills are quite something, Kunitachi-san!

00:14:17.870 --> 00:14:20.210
You're pretty skilled at this.

00:14:21.290 --> 00:14:23.460
The real thing starts now.

00:14:35.810 --> 00:14:38.980
Well then, it's about time I got serious as well.

00:14:43.020 --> 00:14:45.650
This is the legendary dolphin tango!

00:14:46.110 --> 00:14:47.030
That's right.

00:14:47.030 --> 00:14:48.240
I am the dolphin.

00:14:48.240 --> 00:14:50.490
And you are the queen of the ocean.

00:14:50.490 --> 00:14:53.660
If the queen is too mischievous, the ocean will be stormy.

00:14:54.830 --> 00:14:56.330
Both of them are amazing!

00:14:56.330 --> 00:14:57.910
They really are impressive.

00:14:58.960 --> 00:15:01.670
He steps cleverly, like a dolphin splashing around,

00:15:01.670 --> 00:15:07.170
and she elegantly makes her turn around, like a queen.

00:15:07.170 --> 00:15:11.680
This is truly the suited lead for a queen dance.

00:15:11.680 --> 00:15:14.930
For me to be out-danced...

00:15:14.930 --> 00:15:16.560
As if I'd lose to you!

00:15:16.560 --> 00:15:19.430
If it's like this, then faster! Faster!

00:15:22.690 --> 00:15:23.440
Watch out!

00:15:41.420 --> 00:15:43.420
It was a good dance, wasn't it?

00:15:43.790 --> 00:15:45.210
Y-Yes...

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:47.000
Shougo-kun, you are so cool!

00:15:47.000 --> 00:15:48.880
Hug me too!

00:15:57.470 --> 00:15:58.850
Hey wait!

00:15:58.850 --> 00:16:00.890
That was an accident-

00:16:03.310 --> 00:16:05.560
No excuses!

00:16:16.830 --> 00:16:19.160
The moon's spotlight, eh?

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:22.750
This will be a fitting night for a dance with Cinderella.

00:16:29.210 --> 00:16:30.300
Ouch...

00:16:30.300 --> 00:16:33.550
Even though I touched her, she didn't have to kick me so hard...

00:16:34.050 --> 00:16:35.550
That's...

00:16:36.470 --> 00:16:37.470
Miyabi!

00:16:38.430 --> 00:16:40.640
What are you doing here?

00:16:40.640 --> 00:16:42.810
What about you, Shougo?

00:16:42.810 --> 00:16:44.940
The party hasn't ended yet, right?

00:16:44.940 --> 00:16:47.810
Well, I came out to get a breath of fresh air...

00:16:48.400 --> 00:16:52.030
More importantly, aren't you going to the party?

00:16:52.030 --> 00:16:53.390
I won't!

00:16:53.390 --> 00:16:54.740
I have no interest in things like that.

00:16:54.740 --> 00:16:56.870
But you're wearing a dress.

00:16:56.870 --> 00:16:58.990
That's because someone lent it to me.

00:16:58.990 --> 00:17:00.580
I'm wearing it because I don't have a choice.

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:03.000
Since you're already wearing it,

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:04.870
why don't you have a peek at the party?

00:17:04.870 --> 00:17:06.580
How about dancing together inside?

00:17:06.580 --> 00:17:07.630
Why?

00:17:07.630 --> 00:17:10.180
I don't want to dance with you!

00:17:10.180 --> 00:17:11.840
Then how about with someone else?

00:17:11.840 --> 00:17:14.470
I don't want to dance with anyone else!

00:17:14.470 --> 00:17:16.220
Then what do you want to do?

00:17:16.220 --> 00:17:18.200
Just leave me alone!

00:17:18.200 --> 00:17:20.730
I told you I don't want to go to the party.

00:17:24.100 --> 00:17:27.940
I... I want to dance with you, Miyabi.

00:17:32.440 --> 00:17:33.560
You can't!

00:17:33.560 --> 00:17:37.410
I-I can't dance at all.

00:17:37.410 --> 00:17:40.200
If everyone sees, they'll definitely laugh.

00:17:40.200 --> 00:17:42.700
Then how about dancing here?

00:17:43.790 --> 00:17:44.790
Here?

00:17:45.290 --> 00:17:46.150
That's right.

00:17:46.150 --> 00:17:48.790
There's a dance floor right here for the two of us.

00:17:49.500 --> 00:17:51.130
